A thought that came into my mind a few minutes ago without requiring framework changes was to try serialising the bindable directly.

Something like:
```csharp
// Serialize
foreach (var (name, bindable) in ...)
    Settings[name] = JsonConvert.SerializeObject(bindable);

// Deserialize
foreach (var (name, bindable) in ...)
    JsonConvert.PopulateObject(Settings[name], bindable);
```

This is a breaking change though, so maybe not...
